    "en": {
      "trackName": "Mini Golf on Watch",
      "description": "Bring the fun of minigolf to your wrist! Mini Golf on Watch lets you play endlessly unique courses with just a flick of your finger. Perfect for short breaks, commutes, or waiting in line — quick, casual fun is always within reach.\n\nMini Golf on Watch brings the classic game of minigolf to your Apple Watch in a fun, intuitive package designed for quick play sessions.\nChallenge yourself with an endless variety of procedurally generated courses, each featuring unique obstacles like walls and water hazards. Every course is different, ensuring a fresh experience every time you play!\nFeatures:\n\nProcedurally generated courses for unlimited gameplay\nIntuitive drag-and-release controls designed specifically for Apple Watch\nWater hazards, walls, and other obstacles to test your skill\nQuick games perfect for short breaks\nTrack your strokes and try to beat each course under par\nClean, vibrant visuals optimized for the Apple Watch display\n\nPerfect for a quick gaming session during your commute, while waiting in line, or whenever you have a free moment.\nNo need for complicated setups or lengthy tutorials - just launch the app and start playing! Can you master each new course in three strokes or less?\nDownload Mini Golf on Watch today and carry a pocket-sized golf course everywhere you go!",
      "releaseNotes": "New contries and localisations",
